# References both Vec types, which share a short name.
#
# TypeScript imports referenced types by name into one file, so without
# disambiguation this produces two `Vec_1_0` identifiers and tsc rejects
# the file outright. The standard namespace makes this ordinary rather
# than exotic: uavcan.si.unit carries several Vector3 and Scalar types
# in sibling namespaces.

collide.alpha.Vec.1.0 from_alpha
# Nothing interesting.

collide.beta.Vec.1.0 from_beta
# Nothing interesting.

@sealed
